  "correlation_notes": [
    "Samcheok coalfield is used as the reference section",
    "Standard sequence (Samcheok): Manhang → Geumcheon → Jangseong → Hambaeksan → Dosagok → Gohan → Donggo",
    "Bamchi Formation appears in Jeongseon-Pyeongchang, Yeongweol, Mungyeong, and Boeun but not in Samcheok or Gangreung",
    "Southern coalfields (Hwasun, Boseong, Haenam-Gangjin) use distinct local formation names",
    "Western Boeun and Wanju-Geumsan areas use letter designations (B, C, E) for some formations",
    "Donggo Formation extends into Triassic (only in Samcheok and Danyang)",
    "Bakjisan and Sangwonsan formations are Triassic units unique to Jeongseon-Pyeongchang"
  ],

